{"id":8859686469831,"title":"Personalized Desert Sunset Cactus Floral Quilt Set","handle":"personalized-desert-sunset-cactus-floral-quilt-set-machine-washable","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the vibrant beauty of the desert into your home with this stunning Jeminise Cactus \u0026amp; Floral Printed Quilt Set. Featuring a lively array of cacti and flowers in rich, bold colors, this quilt set is perfect for adding a touch of nature-inspired elegance and personalized charm to your bedroom decor.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVibrant Cactus \u0026amp; Floral Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features a lively array of cacti and flowers in rich, bold colors to add a pop of nature-inspired beauty to any bedroom.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your quilt by selecting your preferred size or adding pillowcases and custom text.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102''x91\") to fit various bed dimensions.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e A unique and thoughtful gift for cactus lovers, home décor enthusiasts, or anyone who appreciates vibrant and cheerful bedding.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable for easy cleaning and low-maintenance upkeep.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eComfort \u0026amp; Warmth:\u003c\/strong\u003e The outer layer is made of breathable soft fabric, and the filling material is high-quality silk floss, providing comfort for all seasons.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Can be used as a bed quilt, a picnic mat, or a throw blanket, suitable for various indoor and outdoor settings.\